{
 "description": "R11: joint SPSA over the direction (6 basis vectors of the L40-L47 paired-difference residuals around recheck-avgx, at most 20 degrees from it) and the per-layer residual strengths, from R10's best strengths, on R10's objective rows (job d81b81ca5f6c3b6f0361b6b28f3f1160 in the R10 work folder build/b1/r10/steer10). Run from the repository root against that work folder: python3 -I tools/steer --work build/b1/r10/steer10 --gufo-url URL pipeline tools/steer/examples/r11.json (README.md, \"R11: direction and strengths\").",
 "steps": [
  {
   "name": "train",
